utchGraves3D/main/screenshots/03_ghoul_attack.png","text","mediaReviewed","截图来源核查","value","2026-10-20","language","en","image","gameplay","Creator screenshot rendered by the real game engine through its desktop test simulator.","src","/GameMap/media/learning/butch-graves-j2me.webp","alt","Butch Graves 3D gameplay showing a ghoul approaching the first-person revolver with the phone-sized health and ammo HUD.","https://github.com/WollyMonjac/ButchGraves3D","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","Creator-published screenshot","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型",[92],"Claude 模型 / 对话","创作者开发记录",[97],"evidence","section",{"_61":98,"_25":99,"_100":101},"查看人工与 Claude 的贡献说明","https://github.com/WollyMonjac/ButchGraves3D#butch-graves-3d","note","The creator explicitly distinguishes human briefs, direction and real-device playtests from the model’s implementation and asset tools. Exact Claude client is not identified; the cloud sandbox alone does not establish Claude Code.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[106],{"_61":107,"_25":81,"_100":108},"打开完整 J2ME 游戏与资产","Full Java game, level/resource packs, procedural art/audio tools, tests and packaged full/lite builds. Rebuilding needs JDK8, a MIDP2.0/CLDC1.0 API JAR, ProGuard and the toolchain paths documented in DEVELOPER.md. No repository code license is declared; fonts retain SIL OFL terms.","获取方式","download","demo","试玩与运行",[114],{"_61":115,"_25":116,"_100":117},"下载 Butch Graves 3D","https://github.com/WollyMonjac/ButchGraves3D/tree/main/dist","Ready-built v2.3.0 JAR/JAD files: full game1.7MB or lite build994KB without voices. Requires a compatible MIDP2.0 phone or J2ME Loader, KEmulator or FreeJ2ME; it does not launch with ordinary java -jar. Keypad2/8 moves,4/6 turns,1/3 strafes,5 fires,0 uses,7/9 switches weapons,# jumps and* opens the map. Binary downloaded and inspected, but not executed.","游戏平台","成品下载","指南形式","build log","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[125],{"_61":126,"_25":81,"_100":-7},"阅读作者的开发与测试记录","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[131,132,133,134],"Download the full or lite JAR and open it in a compatible J2ME emulator or MIDP 2.0 phone.","Try moving, turning, firing, using doors and switching weapons during the opening episode.","Read the creator’s implementation account and compare src/E.java with the generated resource packs.","Change one level or resource, follow DEVELOPER.md to rebuild, and verify the phone API, memory and audio constraints on the target runtime.","AI 工作流与开发背景","WollyMonjac 将代码、关卡、美术和音频工具归功于 Claude Opus 5.5。人类提供创作任务与方向，试玩构建并反馈问题；作者也分别说明了桌面模拟、手机模拟器与真机测试的边界。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","3D","track","metadata","引擎","Custom fixed-point raycaster · Java MIDP 2.0 / CLDC 1.0","engine","lead","3d","ai-assisted",[131,132,133,134],{"_61":165,"_25":81,"_17":166},{"_61":164,"_25":116,"_17":110,"_100":117},{"_61":161,"_25":81,"_162":163,"_100":108},{"_61":160,"_25":99,"_100":101},"resourceIds",[],"Read the human and Claude contribution disclosure","Open the complete J2ME game and assets","scope","complete-project","Download Butch Graves 3D","Read the creator’s build and testing account","build-log",{"_168":169},"documents",{"_73":170,"_35":171},[173,177,178,179,176,180,181,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,175,212,174,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233],[172,173,174,175,176],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contr